<title>GREECE: Greek brokers want Delta trades cancelled-SMEHA.</title>
<headline>Greek brokers want Delta trades cancelled-SMEHA.</headline>
<byline>George Georgiopoulos</byline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Athens stock exchange member firms reached common ground after a stormy session on Monday, calling for trades with the Delta Securities brokerage firm from October 30 to be nullified, their association (SMEHA) said in a statement.</p>
<p>The SMEHA statement confirmed earlier accounts by brokers who attended the meeting.</p>
</text>
